[TITLE]
IO-61: a constant 100 cfs external inflow at J1 runs through C1 to outfall
O1 for 10 days (steady flow routing), about 86.4 million ft3 or 646 million
US gallons. All of it leaves through O1.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         STEADY
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/11/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00
WET_STEP             01:00:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:10:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1      10    10        0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type
O1      0     FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset  InitFlow
C1      J1    O1  1000    0.013      0         0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1      CIRCULAR  5      0      0      0      1

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
J1      FLOW         ""          FLOW  1.0      1.0      100

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
